@baseUrl = https://localhost:7259

### Tomt navn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "category": "Strategi", "minPlayers": 2, "maxPlayers": 4 }

### Maks lavere enn min
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ludo", "category": "Familie", "minPlayers": 5, "maxPlayers": 2 }

### Terningkast utenfor 1–6
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/games/1/rating
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 9 }
